# This tree is developed on Windows with `core.autocrlf=true`, which would
# hand every checkout CRLF line endings. The README gates compare exact table
# separators and the suites read files byte for byte, so a CRLF checkout has
# already turned them red once. Pin LF in the working tree instead.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never diff, never convert.
*.png binary
*.tgz binary
